            Hello. That's just a quick take on James Arthur's cover of Hometown Glory by Adele on X
Factor UK. Few chords over and over again. If you're not comfortable with barre chords,
then simply transpose one step lower and put a
Capo on 1st fret and play simple Am G Em
F progression. I hope you like it. ;)

